# D-INODE-CLUSTER-PUBLISH-WITHOUT-AUTHORITY shape (d), hypothesis H-NR1:
# same-build A/B of noino_release_mark_honor on the directed reproducer
# tests/noino_release_reuse_ab.sh, 2/disk/caw/mpath on g2d (test31 test32).
# Run from ~/src/mxfs-f, srcversion 69A9ED8E639EB2D21B613A6: the build the
# third final verification (fx*) runs, the fw build 022F8BF6763B609A9ECC7D1
# plus the H-NR1 fix and its instrument.  8 iterations a lap, NRR_DELAY_MS
# 4000 and NRR_PAUSE_MS 1500 (the harness defaults).
#
# WHAT THE REPRODUCER NOW DOES (nrx5, same build, control, the harness as
# queued here): in 8 of 8 iterations Y's held touch adopted X's freed image
# of N under the EX X's no-inode release left cached (P-NOINO-UNLOCK-LEFT-GRANT
# lifecycle=RECLAIMABLE), set its times and landed them (cc 11 -> 12); X,
# holding C through a pinned sibling it touched after the release, recycled
# the marked corpse for its create (P-RECYCLE-RELEASED-KEEP) and its partial
# write of C carried N's slot with the corpse's staged free image over Y's:
# P-DINO-CLOBBER#1 path=partial regress=1 [s2 ino=8388770 disk cc=12 mode=00
# gen=838510816 nlink=0 -> mem cc=11 mode=00 gen=838510816 nlink=0], fw3c3's
# write; logwr_relmark_regressed=8 on X, node_failures=0, audit CLEAN
# (tests/evidence/20261019T001119Z_noino_release_reuse_nrx5).  The development
# laps nrx1-nrx4 ran earlier forms of the harness and count for nothing here.
#
# VERDICT RULES (written before the first lap):
#   SUPPORTED   at least one control lap (honor 0) reads CONTROL-SHOWS-CAUSE,
#               at least three fix laps (honor 1) read PASS with X's
#               recycle_released_reset > 0 and shaped > 0 (the fix met the
#               shape and ended the corpse's tenure), and no fix lap reads
#               FAIL.
#   FIX FAILS   any fix lap FAIL (X's logwr_relmark_regressed > 0, an X line
#               P-LOGWR-RELMARK-WRITTEN reading staged=1, a P-DINO-CLOBBER
#               regress on either node, a node failure, or a cold audit not
#               CLEAN errors=0): its own lines are attributed before anything
#               else.  It REFUTES H-NR1 if the regressed slot's number logged
#               P-RECYCLE-RELEASED-RESET on X before the write (the tenure was
#               ended and the corpse's bytes were written anyway), or if a
#               staged=1 line names a number whose last recycle before it was a
#               RESET (prediction P2: no slot copied in before an honoured mark
#               is written).
#   WEAK        neither: more laps, not a verdict.
#   A VACUOUS lap (shaped=0) measured nothing and is rerun; an ABORT or an
#   overrun is read from its own lines.  A PASS lap with recycle_reset=0 does
#   not count toward the three.
# The record's shape (d) closes only when this A/B is SUPPORTED and the third
# final verification on this build passes by its own rules, with no landed
# P-DINO-CLOBBER regress of any shape on any node.
#
# Bound per lap, from the harness header's step bounds: prep 300 (run.sh's
